# Netlify redirects for Elara Universe Publishers (https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/)
#
# The QR codes printed in the books point to /resources/<series>/<class>. Those addresses must
# never break. To send one of them to another website later, add one line per address, e.g.:
#
# /resources/technova/3   https://learn.example.com/technova/3   302
# /resources/hindi/1      https://learn.example.com/hindi/1      302
#
# Use 301 instead of 302 once the destination is final. Lines starting with # are comments.
